# M10.2 acceptance, run 1 of 3: slide deck in Single Page, mode switches, View menu.
# tests/data/slides-16x9.pdf (8 slides, 960 x 540 pt, see make_slides_pdf.py):
# each slide has "Slide N" in large type and one line "Point <word>: distinct body
# text for slide N." Run with
#   scripts/shot.sh -o <repo>/.verify/m10.2/<impl|review|tester>/run1 -s tests/acceptance/m10.2.steps -- ./build/app/agentic-reader tests/data/slides-16x9.pdf
# or through tests/acceptance/m10.2.sh, which also runs the two project runs.
#
# Interface choices where the spec is silent (the implementer conforms or files
# a TEST DISPUTE):
#   - The View menu is titled "&View", so Alt+V opens it. Its radio items are
#     "&Continuous" and "&Single Page", the checked one marked by a radio dot.
#   - Ctrl+Shift+L toggles the mode. The toolbar toggle has the same effect.
#   - Page entry (320,48) and Enter jump to a page, as in m2.4.steps.
#   - A layout change is saved to project.json by the same 1 s debounce as a
#     page change. Nothing is saved in this run: the file is not in a project.
#
# Geometry at the default 1400x900 window, as in m2.4.steps: menu bar y 0..27,
# toolbar y 28..68, zoom combo text (35,48), page entry (320,48), PDF pane
# x 225..980 and y 69..875 (client 755x806), pane center (602,472). Status bar
# field 0 is the open file's name.
#
# Single Page of a 960 x 540 page: fit width and fit page are both
# (755 - 24) / 960 = 76%, the page is 731 x 411 px, centered in the pane:
# x 237..968, y about 267..677. Continuous at 76% (fit width): page 3's top edge
# at the top of the pane (y 69 or 81), page 4's top edge about 12 px below its
# bottom edge, at about y 492.
wait 3

# Single Page at open (no entry, the mode is detected from the 16:9 pages): one
# slide, "Slide 1" in large type and its "Point alpha" line inside the grey
# frame, centered in the PDF pane with grey on every side. Combo "76%", entry
# "1 / 8", status field 0 "slides-16x9.pdf". No second slide visible.
shot slides-single

click 320 48
key ctrl+a
type 3
key Return
wait 2

# Single Page on slide 3: "Slide 3" and "Point charlie" centered in the pane.
# Entry "3 / 8", combo "76%".
shot slide-3-single

key ctrl+shift+l
wait 2

# Ctrl+Shift+L switched to Continuous and kept the page: slide 3's top edge at
# the top of the pane (y 69 or 81), its "Slide 3" heading and "Point charlie"
# line at the top, the top of slide 4 (its "Slide 4" heading not yet visible or
# cut off) below it at about y 492. Entry "3 / 8", combo "76%".
shot slide-3-continuous

key ctrl+shift+l
wait 2

# Ctrl+Shift+L switched back to Single Page on slide 3, the same as before the
# first switch. Entry "3 / 8", combo "76%". Identical in layout to slide-3-single.
shot slide-3-single-again

key alt+v
wait 1

# The View menu is open: radio items "Continuous" and "Single Page". "Single
# Page" is the checked one (radio dot), "Continuous" is not. The slide is still
# visible behind the menu, on slide 3.
shot view-menu

key Escape
wait 1

# The menu is closed. Single Page on slide 3, the same as slide-3-single-again.
# Entry "3 / 8".
shot view-menu-closed
